{"vid":"BFJsSnEEGrI","source":"BFJsSnEEGrI.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.2,"txt":"Hi Neil. How are you?"},{"t":1.5,"txt":"I'm very well thank you, Georgie."},{"t":3,"txt":"Are you enjoying your coffee?"},{"t":5.1,"txt":"I am, but it's got a bit cool now."},{"t":8.9,"txt":"I prefer my coffee hot, but..."},{"t":11.6,"txt":"oh well! Are you enjoying yours?"},{"t":14.2,"txt":"I've finished mine."},{"t":15.3,"txt":"Oh, that's a shame."},{"t":16.6,"txt":"It's a sad moment when I've finished my second coffee of the day,"},{"t":21.6,"txt":"because that's it."},{"t":23.6,"txt":"I don't have more than two."},{"t":25.7,"txt":"So, we're talking about coffee in this episode, aren't we?"},{"t":29.5,"txt":"We are. But before we start, of course,"},{"t":32.7,"txt":"everyone needs to know that there is a free worksheet on our website."},{"t":37.9,"txt":"That's at bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":40.8,"txt":"Yes, they can also find a free transcript, can't they?"},{"t":44.1,"txt":"They can, yes, at the same address."},{"t":52.1,"txt":"So, Georgie, we're talking about coffee."},{"t":55.2,"txt":"How much coffee,"},{"t":56.8,"txt":"or how many coffees if we're talking about cups of coffee –"},{"t":61.3,"txt":"how many do you have a day?"},{"t":63.8,"txt":"I usually have two, and I know that you do as well,"},{"t":68,"txt":"because we drink them both in the office, don't we?"},{"t":70.7,"txt":"We have one cup of coffee in the morning and one usually in the afternoon,"},{"t":76.1,"txt":"when we need to regain some energy and alertness."},{"t":81.9,"txt":"Yeah. And so, we all know because we make each other..."},{"t":86.1,"txt":"at BBC Learning English, we make each other coffee,"},{"t":90,"txt":"so we know how we take our coffee."},{"t":93.2,"txt":"Yes. 'How we take our coffee' is how we like it – what we like to put in it."},{"t":98.8,"txt":"For example, sugar or milk."},{"t":101.6,"txt":"I know that you don't like milk in your coffee."},{"t":105,"txt":"You take your coffee black."},{"t":107.2,"txt":"I do. I like black coffee"},{"t":109,"txt":"and you take your coffee white"},{"t":111.7,"txt":"and you used to have sugar, but you don't anymore."},{"t":114.9,"txt":"That's right. Occasionally when I'm at home"},{"t":118.1,"txt":"I put some honey in my coffee to make it a bit sweeter."},{"t":122.3,"txt":"Eurgh! Honey in coffee?"},{"t":124.1,"txt":"Yes. Is that surprising?"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"I've never heard of that."},{"t":127.9,"txt":"Really?"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"Sugar, but not honey."},{"t":131.4,"txt":"But why would that be so bad?"},{"t":134.5,"txt":"Well, I don't know."},{"t":136.2,"txt":"It's just I've never heard of it."},{"t":139.1,"txt":"It's really good."},{"t":140.2,"txt":"I would recommend."},{"t":141.6,"txt":"OK. So, Georgie, what happens if you don't have your coffee?"},{"t":149.3,"txt":"Well, in the morning if I don't have coffee, I feel very grumpy"},{"t":154.3,"txt":"and very tired."},{"t":157.6,"txt":"In the afternoon if I don't have a coffee, it's not terrible,"},{"t":161.5,"txt":"but I would prefer to have my afternoon coffee."},{"t":165.2,"txt":"How about you?"},{"t":166.8,"txt":"Yeah, I need my coffee, especially in the morning,"},{"t":170.8,"txt":"but I don't have my coffee first thing in the morning."},{"t":174.2,"txt":"Oh, interesting."},{"t":175.2,"txt":"I have it, kind of, I don't know... work time – nine o'clock."},{"t":179.9,"txt":"Why is that?"},{"t":181,"txt":"I think it's too strong, too powerful."},{"t":183.6,"txt":"Or maybe just the way I drink it."},{"t":186,"txt":"What happens if you drink too much coffee?"},{"t":188.4,"txt":"Ooh, then it's difficult to sleep because of the caffeine."},{"t":194.1,"txt":"Caffeine is that chemical in coffee and tea that makes you feel awake and alert."},{"t":202.1,"txt":"But too much means you're too alert."},{"t":206.2,"txt":"I don't think that caffeine has a big effect on me."},{"t":211.3,"txt":"I don't think I have trouble sleeping if I drink too much coffee."},{"t":215.4,"txt":"It's strange."},{"t":216.9,"txt":"Yeah, because sometimes I'll have an espresso after dinner."},{"t":220.6,"txt":"Really?"},{"t":221.3,"txt":"Yeah. And I can still sleep."},{"t":223.2,"txt":"That's crazy."},{"t":224.1,"txt":"Yeah. Lucky me."},{"t":225.4,"txt":"Lucky you!"},{"t":227.6,"txt":"Neil, have you ever tried to cut down on coffee?"},{"t":231.2,"txt":"Cut down on... You mean have less?"},{"t":234.4,"txt":"No, I haven't tried to cut down on coffee,"},{"t":237.7,"txt":"but I've tried to cut down on caffeine."},{"t":241.5,"txt":"OK."},{"t":242.1,"txt":"So, I..."},{"t":243.1,"txt":"For a while, I only drank decaffeinated coffee,"},{"t":247.4,"txt":"or decaf, as we call it."},{"t":250.6,"txt":"OK. And how was that?"},{"t":252.2,"txt":"Well, I didn't miss caffeine at the time, I don't think."},{"t":258.2,"txt":"It lasted for a long time, but now I drink caffeine. I don't care."},{"t":271.1,"txt":"OK. Neil, it's time to recap the vocabulary we used in the conversation."},{"t":276.1,"txt":"We used the verb 'take'."},{"t":278.2,"txt":"So, Neil, how do you take your coffee?"},{"t":280.5,"txt":"I take my coffee black, and I know you take your coffee white."},{"t":285.6,"txt":"Yes. We also heard 'caffeine', which is the chemical that is in coffee,"},{"t":290.7,"txt":"which makes you feel more awake."},{"t":292.8,"txt":"Yes, but you can also get decaffeinated coffee or tea – it means"},{"t":297.9,"txt":"there's no caffeine."},{"t":298.9,"txt":"And we usually shorten that just to 'decaf' – decaf coffee."},{"t":303.8,"txt":"Yes. We also heard the phrasal verb 'cut down on',"},{"t":307.2,"txt":"which means you have less of something."},{"t":309.4,"txt":"Yep. And you can also say 'cut back on'."},{"t":312,"txt":"It means the same thing."},{"t":313.8,"txt":"OK. Well, that is the end of this conversation"},{"t":316.2,"txt":"about coffee in Real Easy English."},{"t":319.3,"txt":"Yes, and if people want to watch more episodes"},{"t":322.7,"txt":"of Real Easy English, what should they do?"},{"t":324.6,"txt":"They should go to our website, bbclearningenglish.com,"},{"t":328.4,"txt":"where they can find a free worksheet to test what they've learned."},{"t":331.6,"txt":"Goodbye for now."},{"t":332.6,"txt":"Goodbye!"}],"words":[{"t":0.16,"w":"Hi"},{"t":0.16,"w":"Neil."},{"t":0.16,"w":"How"},{"t":0.16,"w":"are"},{"t":0.16,"w":"you?"},{"t":1.48,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.48,"w":"very"},{"t":1.48,"w":"well"},{"t":1.48,"w":"thank"},{"t":1.48,"w":"you,"},{"t":1.48,"w":"Georgie."},{"t":3.04,"w":"Are"},{"t":3.04,"w":"you"},{"t":3.04,"w":"enjoying"},{"t":3.04,"w":"your"},{"t":3.04,"w":"coffee?"},{"t":5.12,"w":"I"},{"t":5.12,"w":"am,"},{"t":5.12,"w":"but"},{"t":5.12,"w":"it's"},{"t":5.12,"w":"got"},{"t":5.12,"w":"a"},{"t":5.12,"w":"bit"},{"t":5.12,"w":"cool"},{"t":5.12,"w":"now."},{"t":8.92,"w":"I"},{"t":8.92,"w":"prefer"},{"t":8.92,"w":"my"},{"t":8.92,"w":"coffee"},{"t":8.92,"w":"hot,"},{"t":8.92,"w":"but..."},{"t":11.6,"w":"oh"},{"t":11.6,"w":"well!"},{"t":11.6,"w":"Are"},{"t":11.6,"w":"you"},{"t":11.6,"w":"enjoying"},{"t":11.6,"w":"yours?"},{"t":14.24,"w":"I've"},{"t":14.24,"w":"finished"},{"t":14.24,"w":"mine."},{"t":15.32,"w":"Oh,"},{"t":15.32,"w":"that's"},{"t":15.32,"w":"a"},{"t":15.32,"w":"shame."},{"t":16.56,"w":"It's"},{"t":16.56,"w":"a"},{"t":16.56,"w":"sad"},{"t":16.56,"w":"moment"},{"t":16.56,"w":"when"},{"t":16.56,"w":"I've"},{"t":16.56,"w":"finished"},{"t":16.56,"w":"my"},{"t":16.56,"w":"second"},{"t":16.56,"w":"coffee"},{"t":16.56,"w":"of"},{"t":16.56,"w":"the"},{"t":16.56,"w":"day,"},{"t":21.64,"w":"because"},{"t":21.64,"w":"that's"},{"t":21.64,"w":"it."},{"t":23.64,"w":"I"},{"t":23.64,"w":"don't"},{"t":23.64,"w":"have"},{"t":23.64,"w":"more"},{"t":23.64,"w":"than"},{"t":23.64,"w":"two."},{"t":25.72,"w":"So,"},{"t":25.72,"w":"we're"},{"t":25.72,"w":"talking"},{"t":25.72,"w":"about"},{"t":25.72,"w":"coffee"},{"t":25.72,"w":"in"},{"t":25.72,"w":"this"},{"t":25.72,"w":"episode,"},{"t":25.72,"w":"aren't"},{"t":25.72,"w":"we?"},{"t":29.52,"w":"We